# slider-focus (h8-points-slider): the track focused — reached by clicking
# h's box (331.5, 599.5: opens the field, focuses it) and a single Tab to the
# next stop, the slider (the flip-focus pattern: counting Tabs from the body
# is flaky, and a click on the track would jump P). The 3 px primary-32% ring
# shows with the tip. Behaviour: the DOM's activeElement is the slider.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
click 331.5 599.5
wait 200
key Tab
wait 200
shot slider-focus
